      734   PROCEDURE adm-enable :
      735       ENABLE UNLESS-HIDDEN RECT-6 RECT-5 FILL-IN-1 FILL-IN-2 RADIO-sel SumObj ShowNull TOGGLE-3 TOGGLE-1 WITH FRAME F-Main.
      736       RUN enable_UI IN THIS-PROCEDURE NO-ERROR.
      737       RUN set-attribute-list ('ENABLED=yes':U).
      738       RETURN.
      739   END PROCEDURE.
